\intop_{a}^{b}\left(\frac{\left|f\left(x\right)\right|}{\left\Vert f\right\Vert _{p}}\right)^{p}dx=\frac{1}{\left(\left\Vert f\right\Vert _{p}\right)^{p}}\cdot\intop_{a}^{b}\left|f\left(x\right)\right|^{p}dx=\frac{1}{\left(\left\Vert f\right\Vert _{p}\right)^{p}}\cdot\left(\sqrt[p]{\intop_{a}^{b}\left|f\left(x\right)\right|^{p}dx}\right)^{p}=\frac{1}{\left(\left\Vert f\right\Vert _{p}\right)^{p}}\cdot\left(\left\Vert f\right\Vert _{p}\right)^{p}=1
\]


